<code>assert 0 <= index && index <= \old(this.size()) => \forall int i; index <= i && i < \old(this.size()); (i == \old(this.size())-1 || this.get(i+1).equals(\old(this.get(i))));</code>

This ensures that each element from the specified index to the second last element in the old list is shifted to the right by one position in the new list. The last element in the old list is not checked since it is replaced by the newly added element.
